  "1500|2af9e51a": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Coleman Farthing",
   "npc": "1500",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I hope you're well, all things considered.\n\nSit for a spell, and hear my tale.  It's a tragedy, of course, but one I hope will end in revenge!",
   "time": 1791404026,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "2132|db927cdf": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Carolai Anise",
   "npc": "2132",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Nice to see a friendly face. I don't get much chitchat from Apothecary Johaan unless he wants something. He's been out of the grave too long. Someday I'll be like that, I hear. Creepy. Maybe by then I won't care.",
   "time": 1791404136,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "246349|da04ef25": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Breton Samuels",
   "npc": "246349",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "If you've come seeking the fellowship of your fellow paladins, you've come to the right place. \r\n\r\nWelcome home.",
   "time": 1791400297,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "246378|2369eee7": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Danitha Morr",
   "npc": "246378",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Welcome to Bandarion Keep, $c.",
   "time": 1791403931,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "246389|8e0ab317": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Hilda the Breaker",
   "npc": "246389",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Why do they call me \"The Breaker\"?\r\n\r\nTrust me, you don't want to know.",
   "time": 1791403993,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "246389|b676ae27": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Hilda the Breaker",
   "npc": "246389",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "A little bit of a lot of things. Mostly I take the soft and weak and reshape them into hardened fighters once again.\r\n\r\nIt's a tough world out there, and even our own people mistrust us. We need to be tough and self-reliant if we are to fit into this \"Horde\" with the rest of our people.",
   "time": 1791403994,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "246393|4b78c376": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Jorin Croge",
   "npc": "246393",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "There are many things lurking out there in the dark and the light is needed now more than ever. If only these poor souls could see that just because our world has changed doesn't mean we have to be the monsters that the living think we are.",
   "time": 1791403894,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "246393|533ec9c8": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Jorin Croge",
   "npc": "246393",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I make sure we are provisioned and that the scant resources we do have are distributed properly.\r\n\r\nIf this were a proper order, I'd be something of a quartermaster. Such as we are, however, I just do my best to make sure we are at least somewhat equipped to deal with the dangers all around us.",
   "time": 1791400357,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "246394|63539e70": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Ander Solliden",
   "npc": "246394",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "In my previous life, I lived nearby here. I still wander the fields of my childhood farmstead occasionally. It fills me with sadness to see those I knew and loved, shambling around as mindless thralls. It pains me, but it's that very pain that gives me strength and purpose.",
   "time": 1791400481,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "246394|82d61c10": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Ander Solliden",
   "npc": "246394",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Mostly the usual. Murloc attacks, the occasional Scarlet Crusade skirmish. There are even some paladins that can't quite adjust to life as a Forsaken. Far too often we have to put those down that turn their blades upon their brothers. \r\n\r\nBy far the worst is when some mindless thrall wanders too close. I can kill murlocs all day, but some of the scourge I've had to destroy were former friends of mine. Some were even family members.\r\n\r\nI'd rather it be me who puts them down than some random adventurer, but it still stings.",
   "time": 1791400482,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "257655|9f0fb116": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Deathguard Billmuth",
   "npc": "257655",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "<Deathguard Billmuth absentmindedly fidgets as he looks around nervously. He is clearly very uncomfortable being here.>",
   "time": 1791401085,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
